_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Backed out changeset 5822c9d23ff7 (bug 1418629 for causing bug 1565919) to build Thunderbird 68.0. a=jorgk", "files": ["editor/spellchecker/tests/mochitest.ini", "editor/spellchecker/tests/test_bug1418629.html", "extensions/spellcheck/src/mozInlineSpellWordUtil.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b62ef04e0947bf0d621cc87c2314ac3a4a660359", "parents": ["575925ca8346593f2a2796616eeaae774f2ccf79"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jorg K \u003cjorgk@jorgk.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Backed out part of changeset eaf99ba3813a (bug 1362858, part 1, for causing bug 1418629) to build Thunderbird 68.0. a=jorgk", "files": ["extensions/spellcheck/src/mozInlineSpellWordUtil.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0fb2663f9e540d943e9b6ef6617ead9dca2a5981", "parents": ["b62ef04e0947bf0d621cc87c2314ac3a4a660359"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rob Lemley \u003crob@thunderbird.net\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1559199 - Add 'comm' prefix to list of potential index prefixes. r=dustin a=jorgk DONTBUILD\n\nFixes failing index jobs on Thunderbird builds.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D38107", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/morph.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "199420befddc9501c0b4d688cf3390e3092c4074", "parents": ["0fb2663f9e540d943e9b6ef6617ead9dca2a5981"], "tags": []}], "date": 1564274043, "git_changesets": [null, null, null], "user": "mozilla@jorgk.com"}, "115": {"changesets": [{"author": "L10n Bumper Bot \u003crelease+l10nbumper@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\nar -\u003e 04e81829d011\nbg -\u003e c6c2bc1dc99d\nbn -\u003e 84b0a612dd1d\ncs -\u003e cac9b2665142\ncy -\u003e 435f9e71d6db\nda -\u003e b1acd8bc9013\nde -\u003e 25e80a18514b\nel -\u003e fae5d8e83edb\neo -\u003e 73a157a890c5\nes-AR -\u003e ba7e8eb5c396\nes-CL -\u003e 11